        "original_id": "592be71e-835c-5bf3-9dfd-69c7e1f4eb60",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2007 Canadian Grand Prix, 2017 Canadian Grand Prix\n- Places: Circuit Gilles Villeneuve, Montreal, Quebec, Canada\n- People: Lewis Hamilton\n- Organizations: FIA Formula One\n- Topics: Formula One, Canadian Grand Prix\n\nFacts:\n- The 2007 Canadian Grand Prix was a Formula One motor race held on 10 June 2007 at Circuit Gilles Villeneuve in Montreal, Quebec, Canada.\n- Lewis Hamilton's win at the 2007 Canadian Grand Prix was his first win in Formula One and made him the first black driver to win a Formula One race.\n- Circuit Gilles Villeneuve, also spelled Circuit Gilles-Villeneuve in French, is a motor racing circuit in Montreal, Quebec, Canada.\n- Circuit Gilles Villeneuve is the venue for the FIA Formula One Canadian Grand Prix.\n- The 2017 Canadian Grand Prix, formally known as the Formula 1 Grand Prix du Canada 2017, was a Formula One motor race held on 11 June 2017 at Circuit Gilles Villeneuve in Montreal, Quebec, Canada.",
